OL,3,AHead teacher evacuates 900 children
OL,4,Aminutes before school washed away by
OL,5,ANepal floods
OL,6,
OL,7,FWednesday's disaster has killed at
OL,8,Fleast 788 people and more than 2,500
OL,9,Fpeople are missing in Nepal, local
OL,10,Fofficials say
OL,12,FIn Tibet, the official death toll is
OL,13,F16, with 546 reported to be missing,
OL,14,Faccording to Chinese state media -
OL,15,Frescuers are struggling to find
OL,16,Fsurvivors, our correspondent says
